      "comment": "Bosacius: The Nameless Yaksha of The Chasm",
      "content": "Legend tells of an unknown yaksha who fought fiercely beside the Millelith when the monsters of Khaenri'ah invaded The Chasm. He was Bosacius, who no longer remembered his own name, so survivors could not say who he was. Xiao investigated in the Interlude Chapter and confirmed it.",
